  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Partnership for Education Fund II: World Bank as Exclusive Supervising Entity or Implementer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this contribution is to help low-income countries achieve quality basic education, meet the Education for All goals and more specifically the MDG goal that all children complete a full cycle of primary education by 2015.</narrative>
